Free! Egyptian OK Fluvial Marine Props Set with 3 typical Ancient Egyptian OK props. All 3D models ready for POSER James and Simon G2 and DAZ Michael 4. Faithful and accurate Reconstruction. C4D, 3DS, OBJ, POSER, DAZ, VUE6-7-8-9-10!
______________________________________________
SmartCgArt is Member of Archaeological Institute of America [AIA].
Real World Scale Model [SmartCgArt Real World System]. Quads [C4D; OBJ; POSER/DAZ] & Tris [VUE;3DS].
Collection of 3 3D Models with 7 Photoreal and Alternate textures.
3 complete Props Sets ready to be used with POSER [James, Simon G2] and DAZ [Michael 4 character][DAZ is a free Software].
Faithful and accurate Reconstruction of an Ancient Egyptian Old Kingdom Fluvial Marine Props Set to create an Old Kingdom Fluvial Marine, according to the Ancient Egypt wall paintings and the archaeology remains and evidence.
In Ancient Egypt the Fluvial Units of the Naval Forces were troops used for Naval and Boat Combat for River Nile, Lakes and Marsh Lands. They used a ca 3.40 m long pole as weapon to reach, beat and throw the enemies into the water.
In the package you will find:
1- typical Ancient Egyptian OK Loin Cloth Type A [Sculpted HD];
2- typical Ancient Egyptian OK Loin Cloth Type B [Sculpted HD];
3- 1 Long Pole for Fluvial Naval Battles;
4- Complete SET ready for POSER 6 and Up JAMES character;
5- Complete SET ready for DAZ MICHAEL 4 character;
6- Complete SET ready for POSER 7 and Up SIMON G2 character;
7- 7 Hi-Quality Hi-Def PhotoReal Textures [2072x2072; 1000x1000; etc.];
8- Alternate Textures to create different types of elements.
All the Models are prepared Hi-DEF and Photoreal, perfect for any type of Rendering!
POLYGONS/VERTICES COUNT [complete all models Package]
C4D-OBJ-POSER/DAZ: only/mostly quads [43272; 43354]
VUE-3DS: triangulated [86181; 43354]
Enjoy THE NBTY-EGYPT 3D SERIES.
The NBTY 3D series is developing high-fidelity 3D reconstruction of Objects, Architecture and Scenes from Ancient Egypt and Middle East Antiquity.

